#. type: Plain text
#: original/man1/cifsiostat.1:5
msgid "cifsiostat - Report CIFS statistics."
msgstr "cifsiostat - CIFS 統計情報を報告します。"

#. type: SH
#: original/man1/cifsiostat.1:6 original/man1/iostat.1:7
#: original/man1/mpstat.1:6 original/man1/pidstat.1:6 original/man1/sadf.1:6
